WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.240
Copy the name of the body that issued the
document.

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:09.000
Add its date and a reference a reader can
search for, such as a docket or decision
number.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.080
Give the reader a link and the page or
paragraph where the relevant passage
begins.
